# Project Workflow

After **every completed task**, append an entry to `docs/project_log.md`.

## Entry Template

```markdown
## YYYY-MM-DD — [Stage X.Y] Task title

**Summary:** 1–3 sentences on what was done and why.
**Files:** comma-separated list of created/modified paths.
**Status:** completed | blocked | in-progress
```

## Rules

- Append only — never rewrite or delete prior entries.
- Log even small tasks; skip nothing.
- Keep entries concise and professional — no verbose narratives.
- Use roadmap stage IDs when applicable (e.g. `[Stage 0.4]`).
